About SOKOBAN
-------------

Push the bags into the score area (using arrow keys). A bag can only
be pushed if there is a clear space on the other side. When all bags
are in the score area, you can access the next level. There are 89
different levels.

Installation
------------

- Copy the file Sokoban.opa to your \APP\ directory
- Copy the file Sokoban.pic to your \OPD\ directory

Use psion-I to install SOKOBAN as usual.

SOKOBAN will also create several files in the \OPD\ directory of the
internal disk.

