This program is shareware. You can try it freely, but if you continue
to use it you must register. With the shareware version, you can only
play the 10 first level.

To register, send UKP 8 in CASH (or equivalent in CASH in any major
currencies, or a 400 BEF check) to the following address :

Didier Pirottin
Rue des Beguines 5
4600 Vise
Belgium

IF YOU HAVE AN E-MAIL ADDRESS, please send it to me and I will send
your code by email.

IF YOU DON'T HAVE AN E-MAIL ADDRESS, DON'T FORGET to send me a self
addressed envelope, so I can mail your registration code.

When you receive your code, you just have to enter it (press Psion-G
during a game). This will create a file Sokoban.reg in the M:\OPD\
directory, and you will have acces to all 89 levels.

